<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx5.SSx2" title="In Discussion ‣ Assessing Human Rights Risks in AI: A Framework for Model Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Generalizing Takeaways</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx5.SSx3" title="In Discussion ‣ Assessing Human Rights Risks in AI: A Framework for Model Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Operationalizing Risk to Rights</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx5.SSx4" title="In Discussion ‣ Assessing Human Rights Risks in AI: A Framework for Model Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Limitations and Future Work</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx6.SSx4.SSSx3.Px1" title="In Ethics Statement ‣ Assessing Human Rights Risks in AI: A Framework for Model Evaluation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Overreliance on Quantification.</span></a></li>
