<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>A. Annotation Questions</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Binary:</p>
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does this headline appear clear and unbiased?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does this headline appear factual and informative?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the headline mention the ethnic identity of the group?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the headline mention the immigration status of the group?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the headline mention the legal status of the group?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the headline mention the accusation toward the group?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the headline mention the increasing population of the group?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the headline describe Trump’s statement?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i9" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the headline describe Trump’s statement as a “claim”?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i10" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the headline describe the evidence (or lack thereof) in support of Trump’s statement?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i11" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i11.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i11.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the headline imply others’ refutation of Trump’s statement?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i12" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i12.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i12.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the headline describe Trump’s statement as false?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i13" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i13.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i13.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the headline perpetuate Trump’s claim?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i14" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i14.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i14.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the headline describe Trump’s statement as rambling?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i15" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i15.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i15.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the headline describe Trump’s statement as racist?</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i16" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i16.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i16.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the headline describe Trump’s statement as extremist?</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Ordinal:</p>
<ul id="A1.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the headline exhibit political bias?</p>
<ul id="A1.I2.i1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I2.i1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I2.i1.I1.i1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Right, Right-Center, Neutral, Left-Center, Left</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="A1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Free Response</p>
<ul id="A1.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the headline describe Trump’s statement in any other notable way (optional)?</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>B. Model Architecture</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The neural network used in this study is implemented using the <span id="A2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Keras</span> Sequential API. The architecture is described below:</p>
<ul id="A2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input Layer</span>: Dense layer with 64 units, ReLU activation, and an input dim of 14.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hidden Layer</span>: Dense layer with 128 units and ReLU activation.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output Layer</span>: Dense layer with 768 units and linear activation, appropriate for regression tasks.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Compilation</span>: The model is compiled using the Adam optimizer with a learning rate of 0.001 and the mean squared error (MSE) loss function.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
